   "`office.js`: in the TV block, compute `cars = state.cars` (owned or rented, all of them). Call `const shown = drawTvCar(ctx, OFFICE.tvScreen, cars, t);`. When `shown` is true skip `drawTvStatic` and the 'WEBB TV' and 'Tap me to shop!' captions; when false keep the existing static and captions exactly as now (call `drawTvStatic` only in that branch). Before the HUD strip call add `drawHudCar(ctx, OFFICE.hudCar, state.cars, app.selectedCarId, t);`. Add the tap hotspot: a hit `hudcar` on `OFFICE.hudCar` that calls `app.push('garage')` (use the id the scene already uses for the garage hotspot).",
