 dict(id="CC16", title="Auction: lot on a curtained stage, no text on the car", needs=["CC01", "CC07", "CC08", "W65b"],
  files=["src/ui/scenes/auction.js", "tests/scene_auction_a.test.mjs"],
  goal="The auction stage becomes a curtained hall with the lot as the star. Today the lot name, year and estimate are written across the top of the car. Move that text into a lot card on the left and stand the car right of it. A hidden condition must not leak through the wear state.",
  read=[PLAN, "src/ui/scenes/auction.js (drawHall, the picture block in draw, LAYOUT.picture)", "tests/scene_auction_a.test.mjs", "src/art/modelcar.js, src/art/stage.js", "src/ui/kit_draw.js (panel, paragraph, label)", FAKE],
  steps=[
   "Replace the body of `drawHall(ctx, t)` below the first `ink` room fill with `drawStage(ctx, LAYOUT.picture, 'auction', t)` (keep the dark room fill, the glow rect and the gavel drawing exactly as they are; remove only the plank, seam and spotlight cone code). Import `drawStage`, `drawModelCar`, `makeTracker, driveIn`; drop `drawCar` and `paintOf`. `auctionScene.tr = makeTracker()` in `enter`.",
   "Car: `g = drawStage(...)` (call once per frame; have drawHall return the stage result and use it), `el = tr.update(this.lotIndex + ':' + view.name, t)`, `dx = -driveIn(el, 0.8, 700)` (the lot rolls in from the right), then `drawModelCar(ctx, model.id, 720 + dx, g.groundY, 2, {cond: view.revealed.condition ? view.values.condition : 6, t, slot:{w: 620, h: g.groundY - LAYOUT.picture.y - 8}, bob: el > 0.8, reflect: true, shine: el > 0.8})` clipped to the picture rect. The unrevealed condition keeps the fixed value 6 (wear state 1) so the picture never reveals the hidden number.",
   "Lot card: a `panel(ctx, 144, 124, 270, 150, {shadow:false})` on the stage left; inside: `LOT n/N` (title font 18, `PALETTE.lamp`), the lot name with `paragraph(ctx, view.name, 156, 150, 246, {size: 26})` (max 3 lines), year then `Estimate Lxx to Lyy` (same `money()` text as now) as two body-font lines size 24 at y 232 and 256 inside the card. Remove the old four centred `label` calls over the car. Keep every hit, button and bidding code untouched.",
   "Tests (keep existing; adjust only assertions that read the old text positions): with fake art, drawing a lot makes one `drawImage` whose rect lies inside `LAYOUT.picture` and whose left edge is greater than 414 (never over the lot card); the lot name text is drawn at an x < 414; an unrevealed condition gives an image id ending `|1`; revealing condition 2.0 (set `revealed.condition` and `values.condition = 2`) gives `|3`; art uninstalled: no drawImage."],
  accept=["`sh tools/run_tests.sh 2>&1 | grep scene_auction` shows PASS for all auction test files."]),

